  "title": "Addictive Pumpkin Muffins",
  "description": "A low-fat version of a pumpkin bread recipe using no oil. Try using a heat stable sugar substitute for half of the sugar for an even healthier treat.",
  "authors": [
    "MIDNITEJASMINE"
  ],
